<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Use Case Descriptions - SRS Format</title>
<style>
@page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 1in;
}
body {
    font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11pt;
    line-height: 1.3;
}
h2 {
    font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14pt;
    color: #000;
    margin-top: 14pt;
    margin-bottom: 6pt;
    font-weight: bold;
}
table {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 12pt;
}
th, td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    vertical-align: top;
    font-size: 10.5pt;
}
.label-col {
    font-weight: bold;
    width: 24%;
    color: #000;
    text-align: left;
}
.sub-label {
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    background-color: #ffffff;
}
.page-break {
    page-break-before: always;
}
ol.actor-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 22px;
}
ol.actor-list li {
    margin-bottom: 3pt;
    text-align: left;
}
ol.system-list {
    list-style-type: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 0;
}
ol.system-list li {
    margin-left: 26px;
    text-indent: -26px;
    margin-bottom: 3pt;
    text-align: left;
}
p {
    margin: 0 0 4pt 0;
    padding: 0;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h2>3.2.1 UC001 Login</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC001</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>Login</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer, Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Actors log in into the Plumbfix web-based system.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor must have a registered account.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor can successfully log in to their respective dashboard.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Actor browses to Plumbfix login page.</li>
        <li>Actor enters email and password.</li>
        <li>Actor clicks "Login" button.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System displays login form with email and password fields.</li>
        <li>3.1 System validates credentials.</li>
        <li>3.2 System redirects to the respective dashboard (Customer Dashboard or Staff Dashboard).</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'><strong>Google Login:</strong> (1) Actor clicks "Login with Google". (1.1 System redirects to Google OAuth, verifies user profile, sets session, and redirects to dashboard).</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'><strong>Invalid credentials:</strong> (3.1) If credentials fail database match, system displays "These credentials do not match our records." and asks user to try again.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>Validate Credentials</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Google Login is only available to Customers.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.2 UC002 Create Account</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC002</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>Create Account</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Staff and Customer</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Creates a new user account profile in the system.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>A new active account is registered in the database.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>Medium</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <p><strong>For Customer registration:</strong></p>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Customer clicks "Register" link on login page.</li>
        <li>Customer inputs details (Name, Email, Phone, Address, Password, Bank Info) and clicks "Register".</li>
      </ol><br>
      <p><strong>For Admin creating a Plumber profile:</strong></p>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Admin navigates to "Plumbers" menu.</li>
        <li>Admin clicks "Add Plumber" button.</li>
        <li>Admin inputs plumber's name, email, phone, and password, and clicks "Save Plumber".</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System redirects to Registration page and displays form fields.</li>
        <li>2.1 System validates details for uniqueness.</li>
        <li>2.2 System registers Customer and redirects to dashboard.</li>
      </ol><br>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System redirects to Plumber list page.</li>
        <li>2.1 System displays form dialog.</li>
        <li>3.1 System validates details.</li>
        <li>3.2 System saves Plumber account in database with active status and refreshes list.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>If user enters incomplete information, the system asks user to complete all required fields</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'>If required fields are invalid, the system displays an error message and requests correction</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>Validate Input Data</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.3 UC003 View Account</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC003</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>View Account</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer, Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor views their personal account profile details.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor must be logged in.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Account details are successfully displayed.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>Medium</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>Medium</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Actor clicks on the "Profile" link in the navigation menu.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System queries database for authenticated user ID.</li>
        <li>1.2 System redirects to Profile page.</li>
        <li>1.3 System displays current profile details (Name, Email, Phone No, Address, Bank details, and Avatar).</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Staff accounts do not contain banking details.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.4 UC004 Update Account</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC004</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>Update Account</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer, Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor updates their profile account information.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor must be logged in and on the Profile page.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Account data is updated in the database.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>Low</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Actor modifies editable fields (Name, Phone No, Address, Bank info, or uploads new Avatar).</li>
        <li>Actor clicks on the "Update Profile" button.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>2.1 System validates updated inputs.</li>
        <li>2.2 System saves changes to database.</li>
        <li>2.3 System displays success alert message: "Profile updated successfully!".</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'><strong>Invalid inputs:</strong> (2.1) If input validation fails (e.g. invalid phone number format), system displays error tips.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>Validate Input Data</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Avatar uploaded must be an image file (JPEG, PNG, etc.) under 2MB.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.5 UC005 Delete Account</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC005</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>Delete Account</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Staff (Admin)</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Admin deletes a plumber's account profile from the system.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Admin is logged in.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Plumber account is removed from the database.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>Medium</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>Low</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Admin navigates to the "Plumbers" menu.</li>
        <li>Admin finds Plumber and clicks "Delete" button.</li>
        <li>Admin clicks "OK" to confirm.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System displays plumbers list table.</li>
        <li>2.1 System displays confirmation popup: "Are you sure you want to delete this plumber?".</li>
        <li>3.1 System deletes the staff record from database.</li>
        <li>3.2 System displays success message: "Plumber deleted successfully!" and refreshes list.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Admin cannot delete their own account.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.6 UC006 Create Booking</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC006</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>Create Booking</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer schedules a new plumbing service appointment.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer is logged in.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Booking is saved as "Pending" and redirects to payment window.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Customer clicks "Create Booking" on menu.</li>
        <li>Customer selects Service Type, Date, Time Slot, and fills problem description.</li>
        <li>Customer uploads problem photos (optional) and clicks "Submit Booking".</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System redirects to booking form page.</li>
        <li>1.2 System fetches booked slots to display on calendar.</li>
        <li>3.1 System validates time slot availability.</li>
        <li>3.2 System saves booking record in database with "Pending" status.</li>
        <li>3.3 System redirects customer to deposit payment page.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'><strong>Time slot overlap:</strong> (3.1) If the slot is booked during customer entry, system prompts: "The selected time slot is already booked."</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>Validate Input Data</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Booking is not assigned to a plumber until deposit is verified.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.7 UC007 View Booking</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC007</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>View Booking</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer, Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor views their active or historical list of bookings.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor is logged in.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Bookings lists are rendered.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Actor clicks "Bookings" in sidebar menu.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System checks authenticated role.</li>
        <li>1.2 System retrieves bookings linked to User ID.</li>
        <li>1.3 System displays bookings table showing Booking ID, Type, Date, Time, Status, and Action buttons.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Staff sees bookings assigned to them; Admin sees all bookings.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.8 UC008 Update Booking</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC008</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>Update Booking</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer, Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Staff/Admin updates booking parameters, plumber assignment, or progress status.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor is logged in.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Booking record is updated in database.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>Medium</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <p><strong>For Plumber updating job status:</strong></p>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Plumber navigates to bookings list.</li>
        <li>Plumber clicks "Update Status" dropdown, selects progress stage (e.g. "In Progress"), and clicks save.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System displays active assigned bookings list.</li>
        <li>2.1 System updates booking status in database.</li>
        <li>2.2 System triggers notification alert to Customer.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'><strong>Admin assigning booking:</strong> (1) Admin clicks "Verify Payment" -> approves slip -> selects Plumber. (1.1 System sets Booking status to "Confirmed" and assigns selected Plumber ID).</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Booking status workflow goes: Pending -> Confirmed -> In Progress -> Completed.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.9 UC009 Delete Booking</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC009</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>Delete Booking</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer cancels an active booking, triggering refund checks.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Booking status must not be Completed or In Progress.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Booking is soft-deleted/cancelled and refund checks are triggered.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>Low</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Customer finds booking in lists and clicks "Cancel Booking".</li>
        <li>Customer inputs Cancellation Reason & Description.</li>
        <li>Customer clicks "Confirm Cancellation" button.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System redirects customer to cancellation page.</li>
        <li>3.1 System calculates refund eligibility.</li>
        <li>3.2 System saves booking status as "Cancelled", records refund amount, and triggers alerts to staff.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'><strong>Ineligible Cancel:</strong> (1.1) If booking is already Completed or In Progress, cancel button is disabled.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Refund eligibility is determined by 24h and 48h notice windows.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.10 UC010 Create Payment</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC010</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>Create Payment</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
