</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer uploads bank deposit receipt slip for a pending booking.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Booking has been created.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>PaymentReceipt record is logged in database.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Customer opens the deposit payment page.</li>
        <li>Customer selects Payment Method, uploads receipt file, and clicks "Submit Payment".</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System displays payment details (RM 70.00) and bank account details.</li>
        <li>2.1 System validates file type and size.</li>
        <li>2.2 System saves receipt file in storage, inserts record in payment_receipts database table, and alerts administrators.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'><strong>Upload failure:</strong> (2.1) If receipt upload is not a PDF/image or exceeds 4MB, system halts submission.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>Validate Input Data</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Multiple receipts can be uploaded if previous attempts were rejected by Admin.</td></tr>
</table>
