    <td>
      <p><strong>For Payment Approval:</strong></p>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Admin reviews receipt, selects an active Plumber, and clicks "Approve".</li>
      </ol><br>
      <p><strong>For Payment Rejection:</strong></p>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Admin enters rejection reason and clicks "Reject".</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System marks Payment Status as "Paid" and Booking Status as "Confirmed".</li>
        <li>1.2 System assigns plumber ID to booking, deducts inventory, generates receipt PDF, and sends confirmation email.</li>
      </ol><br>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System marks Payment Status as "Rejected" and saves rejection reason.</li>
        <li>1.2 System sends notification alert to Customer.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Approving payment requires plumber assignment to confirm the slot.</td></tr>
</table>
