</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Triggers automated refund request log on booking cancellation.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer cancels a booking which has payment status "Paid".</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>A new pending refund record is logged in database.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>Medium</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>Low</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Customer cancels a paid booking.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System calls refund eligibility calculations.</li>
        <li>1.2 System checks cancellation timing constraints.</li>
        <li>1.3 System creates a pending Refund record with calculated refund amount, and notifies admin.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'><strong>Non-eligible cancellation:</strong> (1.2) If cancellation is initiated under 24 hours prior, system sets refund status to 'not_applicable' and refund amount to 0.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Refund request is created automatically and does not require a separate Customer form.</td></tr>
</table>
