  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Job Record details are updated.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>Medium</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>Low</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Plumber opens Job Records list.</li>
        <li>Plumber selects record and clicks "Edit Job Record".</li>
        <li>Plumber updates values and clicks "Update Record".</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System displays list of completed job sheets.</li>
        <li>2.1 System displays the data-filled form (Labor, Parts cost, Notes).</li>
        <li>3.1 System recalculates total cost, saves updates to database, and shows confirmation popup: "Job record updated successfully!".</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Job Record edits do not change the booking status (remains Completed).</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.19 UC019 Generate Report</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC019</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>Generate Report</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Admin generates and views system performance reports.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Admin is logged in.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Reports graphs and averages are displayed.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>Medium</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Admin clicks on "Analytics" in menu panel.</li>
        <li>Admin selects Calendar Year from dropdown menu.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System retrieves bookings transaction statistics for current year.</li>
        <li>2.1 System recalculates monthly completed/cancelled ratios.</li>
        <li>2.2 System renders monsoonal peak averages and staffing surge suggestions.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Analytics rely on rain seasons indexes (Dry Season: April-Oct, Rainy Season: Nov-March).</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.20 UC020 Create Feedback</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC020</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>Create Feedback</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer, Staff</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer submits a service review rating for a completed booking.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Booking status is Completed.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Feedback record is logged in database feedbacks table.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>Medium</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>Medium</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Customer opens a completed booking page.</li>
        <li>Customer clicks "Submit Feedback".</li>
        <li>Customer rates service, enters comments, uploads photos, and clicks "Submit".</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System displays booking overview and "Submit Feedback" button.</li>
        <li>2.1 System displays feedback popup form with Rating Stars (1-5), Comments box, and File Upload fields.</li>
        <li>3.1 System saves feedback linked to bookingID.</li>
        <li>3.2 System displays confirmation: "Thank you for your feedback!" and alerts the assigned plumber.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Feedback rating is mandatory; comment and photos are optional.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.21 UC021 View Feedback</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC021</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>View Feedback</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Staff/Admin views ratings and comments submitted by customers.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Staff/Admin is logged in.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Feedback log list is displayed.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>Medium</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>Medium</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Staff clicks "Feedback" menu tab.</li>
        <li>Staff selects a feedback.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System queries database for feedbacks database records.</li>
        <li>1.2 System displays list of ratings, booking types, customer names, and review comments.</li>
        <li>2.1 System displays full details including uploaded photos, and shows "Reply" button for staff response.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Feedback replies (staffResponse) are saved directly onto the feedback record.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.22 UC022 Create Chat Message</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC022</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>Create Chat Message</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer, Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor sends live messages to coordinate booking schedules.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Booking must be active (not completed or cancelled).</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Message is stored in database and broadcasted in real-time.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Actor opens active booking details.</li>
        <li>Actor inputs text message in text input bar.</li>
        <li>Actor clicks "Send" button (or presses Enter key).</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System displays booking overview and "Live Chat" widget window.</li>
        <li>3.1 System saves chat message record in database (setting is_read = false).</li>
        <li>3.2 System fires Pusher event broadcast to push message dynamically to recipient viewport.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'><strong>Empty message:</strong> (3.1) If text input is blank, system disables send trigger.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Live chat messages are isolated to bookingID.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.23 UC023 View Chat Messages</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC023</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>View Chat Messages</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer, Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor views active message logs inside booking chat interface.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor is logged in and booking is active.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Conversation logs are rendered, and unread flags are marked read.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Actor opens booking details chat window.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System fetches message logs for bookingID.</li>
        <li>1.2 System updates unread messages (setting is_read = true).</li>
        <li>1.3 System renders conversation history vertically in viewport.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Visual indicators (read receipts) update dynamically.</td></tr>
</table>
<div class='page-break'></div>

<h2>3.2.24 UC024 View Push Notifications</h2>
<table class='header-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case ID:</td><td colspan='3'>UC024</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Use Case Name:</td><td colspan='3'>View Push Notifications</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Created By:</td><td style='width:33%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td><td style='width:18%; font-weight:bold;'>Last Updated By:</td><td style='width:25%;'>Muhammad Adib Is'ad Bin Mohd Zulkefli</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Date Created:</td><td>4/4/2026</td><td style='font-weight:bold;'>Date Last Updated:</td><td>19/7/2026</td></tr>
</table>
<table class='body-table'>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Actor:</td><td colspan='2'>Customer, Staff, Admin</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Description:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor views their personal notification list to check recent updates.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Preconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Actor is logged in.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Postconditions:</td><td colspan='2'>Unread notifications list is displayed and marked as read.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Priority:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Frequency of Use:</td><td colspan='2'>High</td></tr>
  <tr><td rowspan='2' class='label-col'>Normal Course of Events:</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>Actor</td><td class='sub-label' style='width:38%;'>System</td></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <ol class='actor-list'>
        <li>Actor clicks on the "Notification Bell" icon in top header.</li>
        <li>Actor clicks on "Mark all as read" button (or navigates to page).</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
    <td>
      <ol class='system-list'>
        <li>1.1 System fetches unread notifications from DB for authenticated user ID.</li>
        <li>1.2 System displays dropdown showing last 5 unread alerts (Booking assignments, Payment updates, or Cancel logs).</li>
        <li>2.1 System updates all notifications status in database (sets read_at timestamp).</li>
        <li>2.2 System updates header bell icon counter to 0.</li>
      </ol>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Alternative Courses:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Exceptions:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Includes:</td><td colspan='2'>N/A</td></tr>
  <tr><td class='label-col'>Notes and Issues:</td><td colspan='2'>Polling routes fetch unread alert counts periodically.</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
